 ♦³ + ♠² = ?", "options": ["13", "15", "25", "17"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "$2^3+3^2=8+9=17$।"}, {"q": "यदि P = 1, Q = 2, R = 3 हो तो PQR मिलाकर कौन-सी संख्या बनेगी?", "options": ["132", "321", "123", "12"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "अंकों को क्रम से लिखें।"}, {"q": "यदि चिह्न ● का मतलब 'दुगुना करना' है तो ●7=?", "options": ["7", "49", "77", "14"], "answer": 3, "explanation": "$7\\times2=14$।"}], "images_base": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aloklmp99/khaki/main/his/rap-abstract/", "images": ["s", "ty", "ex", "st", "tp"]}